# 🎵 AudioAnalyzer / BeatService

One of the more specialized systems developed for Sunset Party Club is the game's audio-reactive infrastructure.

The system analyzes music and exposes gameplay events based on the audio.

### Features

* Audio normalization
* Beat detection
* Drop detection
* Audio intensity analysis
* Reactive visual effects
* Event-based audio communication

Example conceptual flow:

```text
Sound
  ↓
Audio Analyzer
  ↓
Beat Detection
  ↓
BeatService
  ├── OnBeat
  └── OnDrop
        ↓
Visual Systems
 ├── Lights
 ├── Lasers
 ├── Particles
 └── Environment Effects
```

The goal is to allow different systems to react to music without every effect having to independently analyze the audio.

