# 🔧 Development Approach

I try to avoid creating extremely large scripts responsible for an entire game.

Instead, systems are separated according to responsibility.

For example:

```text
RoundManager
      ↓
RoleManager
      ↓
CombatManager
      ↓
RewardManager
      ↓
Player Data
```

Each system has a specific purpose and communicates with other systems through controlled interfaces.

This makes it easier to debug problems and modify individual systems without unnecessarily affecting unrelated parts of the game.

